      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FOXY JAY (7) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 22.27 beating Intrigue. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Can continue on her winning ways. LAKEVIEW MITCH (8) had been racing in honest fashion recording three placings in a row before finishing fifth (22.64) at this track latest. Goes well out of this box with a win and six minor placings. Has ability and can atone. GOT A MESSAGE (1) turned in a plain run last time when fifth at Wagga over 320m behind Chasin' Opie (18.84) in a Grade 5. Can measure up this time. ASTON FAME (2) profiles nicely over this trip.",
